  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Gu Masters are divided into nine ranks of great realms, and each great realm has four small realms: initial, middle, upper, and peak stage.",
      "chapters": [
        230
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "From the general aspect, ranks one to five are mortal, while six to nine are immortal. Among ten million Gu Masters, not even one might become an immortal.",
      "chapters": [
        275
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A rank nine Gu Master stands at the top of the universe in that era’s legend. Spectral Soul Demon Venerable is named as the rank nine Gu Immortal with the greatest killing nature among Immortal Venerables and Demon Venerables.",
      "chapters": [
        422
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "apex-of-an-era",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_master",
        "char_spectral_soul_demon_venerable",
        "sys_gu_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Over more than three million years, ten Gu cultivators stand at the peak as the ten rank nine Gu Immortals, the ten great venerables. Those figures occupy rank nine venerable as their cultivation level; venerable is that rank nine level, not a step past it. Each great era has only one venerable.",
      "chapters": [
        2085
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "venerable-level",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After becoming rank nine, calamities and tribulations become even more terrifying. Venerables face a grand tribulation every ten years, a myriad tribulation every fifty years, and a chaotic disaster every one hundred years.",
      "chapters": [
        2209
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "after-rank-nine",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The titled height of that rank is covered on Gu Venerable. The rung below is covered on Rank Eight. The mortal stretch through rank five is covered on Rank One through Rank Five. Immortal entry and mid ranks sit on Rank Six, Rank Seven, and Rank Eight. The wider ladder is covered on ranks and realms. Gu Immortals from rank six up are covered on Gu Immortal.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
